<title>USA: United Healthcare acquires systems company.</title>
<headline>United Healthcare acquires systems company.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Healthcare Corp said Wednesday its Applied Healthcare Informatics Inc unit recently completed the acquisition of O'PIN Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>O'PIN is a supplier of health data analysis systems for the managed care industry.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
